<h3>Open Trailers</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Cost‑effective</strong> – Open trailers are generally cheaper and widely available for <strong>car relocation services</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>Easy loading</strong> – No side doors mean quicker loading and unloading, useful for bulk moves.</li>
<li><strong>Limited protection</strong> – Exposure to rain, dust, wind and road debris can lead to surface corrosion, paint chips and mechanical wear.</li>
<li><strong>Higher security risk</strong> – Open decks are more vulnerable to vandalism, especially during overnight stops.</li>
<li><strong>Not ideal for premium bikes</strong> – High‑end motorcycles benefit from the sealed environment of an enclosed carrier.</li>
</ul>
